WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.650
Step four reads the diff.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:04.419
The plus lines add eligible assignments:

3
00:00:04.419 --> 00:00:09.712
User Access Administrator at the root
management group, Tier 0, for ninety days;

4
00:00:09.712 --> 00:00:14.109
Owner on the workload subscription,
twice; and Contributor on the

5
00:00:14.109 --> 00:00:18.588
payroll resource group, twice, each
for a hundred eighty days, Tier 1.

6
00:00:18.588 --> 00:00:20.162
Three of them say converted.

7
00:00:20.162 --> 00:00:22.964
Each converted line has
its minus line below:

8
00:00:22.964 --> 00:00:27.810
the standing User Access Administrator,
Owner and Contributor assignments

9
00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:32.126
those holders had, each removed only
after its eligible replacement.

10
00:00:32.126 --> 00:00:33.962
Eligible replacement first.

11
00:00:33.962 --> 00:00:39.550
Then count the tilde lines: seventy policy
rule changes, across the governed scopes.

12
00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:43.080
The slide shortens the I
D's and scope names to fit.
